OL,3,AOnly Roland Garros towel left, says
OL,4,AUkraine tennis player after Russian
OL,5,Astrike hits flat
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian tennis player Dayana
OL,8,FYastremska has said her family's flat
OL,9,Fhas been destroyed in a Russian aerial
OL,10,Fstrike on the Black Sea port of Odesa.
OL,12,F"This is what the 'Russian world' looks
OL,13,Flike. A direct hit by a Kalibr cruise
OL,14,Fmissile," she wrote on social media,
OL,15,Fshowing a photo of a burning
OL,16,Fmulti-storey residential building.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
