OL,3,AOnly Roland Garros towel left, says
OL,4,AUkraine tennis player after Russian
OL,5,Astrike hits flat
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The only thing that survived was a
OL,8,FRoland Garros... towel," the
OL,9,F26-year-old added, posting an image of
OL,10,Fa famous clay orange towel from Paris's
OL,11,FGrand Slam tournament hanging from the
OL,12,Fwreckage.
OL,14,FOdesa regional head Oleh Kiper said 37
OL,15,Fpeople were injured, including a baby,
OL,16,Fand two missing in the missile and
OL,17,Fdrone attack on Odesa and nearby
OL,18,FChornomorsk on Friday night.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
